<div class="py-8 lg:py-10 max-w-screen-xl mx-auto px-4">
  <%!-- Intro Section --%>
  <div class="prose prose-zinc prose-a:text-blue-600 max-w-3xl mb-10">
    <h1 class="mt-0">YSC Choir</h1>
    <p>
      The YSC Choir is a warm and welcoming community choir rooted in Scandinavian musical tradition. We perform a diverse repertoire spanning Nordic folk songs, classical choral works, and contemporary pieces — all while celebrating the culture and spirit that bring our club together.
    </p>
    <p>
      No auditions. No prior choral experience required. If you love to sing and want to share that joy with fellow members, the YSC Choir is the place for you. We welcome singers of all voice types and experience levels.
    </p>
  </div>

  <%!-- Photo Placeholder --%>
  <%!-- Replace this block with an <img> tag once a photo is available --%>
  <div class="w-full aspect-video rounded-2xl bg-zinc-100 border border-zinc-200 flex flex-col items-center justify-center mb-12 overflow-hidden">
    <.icon name="hero-musical-note" class="w-16 h-16 text-zinc-300 mb-3" />
    <p class="text-sm text-zinc-400 font-medium">Photo coming soon</p>
  </div>

  <%!-- Two Column: Schedule + Contact --%>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 mb-14">
    <%!-- Left: Practice Schedule --%>
    <div class="not-prose space-y-6">
      <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-2">
        <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-600 flex-shrink-0">
          <.icon name="hero-calendar-days" class="w-5 h-5" />
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">
          Practice Schedule
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl divide-y divide-zinc-100 overflow-hidden">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-white hover:bg-zinc-50 transition-colors duration-150">
          <div class="w-36 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black text-blue-600 bg-blue-50 px-2.5 py-1 rounded uppercase tracking-widest whitespace-nowrap">
              Every Sunday
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 leading-snug">
              Weekly Rehearsal
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mt-0.5">7:00 PM – 9:00 PM</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4 p-5 bg-white hover:bg-zinc-50 transition-colors duration-150">
          <div class="w-36 flex-shrink-0">
            <span class="text-xs font-black text-zinc-500 bg-zinc-100 px-2.5 py-1 rounded uppercase tracking-widest whitespace-nowrap">
              Seasonal
            </span>
          </div>
          <div class="flex-1 min-w-0">
            <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 leading-snug">
              Performances & Concerts
            </p>
            <p class="text-sm text-zinc-500 mt-0.5">
              Scheduled around YSC events and holidays
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="p-5 border border-zinc-200 rounded-xl bg-white hover:border-zinc-300 transition-colors duration-200">
        <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
            <.icon name="hero-map-pin" class="w-5 h-5" />
          </span>
          <div>
            <p class="font-semibold text-zinc-900 mb-0.5">Practice Location</p>
            <p class="text-zinc-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Scandinavian Cultural Center<br />
              2600 Sunset Blvd, San Francisco, CA 94116
            </p>
            <p class="text-zinc-500 text-xs mt-2">
              Parking available on-site. Enter through the main hall.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <%!-- Right: Contact Card --%>
    <div class="not-prose">
      <div class="p-8 bg-blue-50 rounded-3xl border border-blue-100 h-fit sticky top-8">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-5">
          <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-blue-100 text-blue-600 flex-shrink-0">
            <.icon name="hero-chat-bubble-left-ellipsis" class="w-5 h-5" />
          </span>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">
            Get in Touch
          </h2>
        </div>

        <p class="text-sm text-zinc-700 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Interested in joining or have a question about the choir? We'd love to hear from you. Reach out directly or drop us a note through the contact form.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4 mb-6">
          <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
            <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-8 h-8 rounded-full bg-white text-zinc-500 flex-shrink-0 border border-zinc-200">
              <.icon name="hero-envelope" class="w-4 h-4" />
            </span>
            <div>
              <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-zinc-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-0.5">
                Email
              </p>
              <a
                id="choir-contact-email"
                href="mailto:choir@ysc.org"
                class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-600 hover:underline transition-colors duration-150"
              >
                choir@ysc.org
              </a>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <.link
          id="choir-contact-cta"
          navigate={
            ~p"/contact?subject=Choir&message=#{URI.encode("Hi, I'm interested in learning more about the YSC Choir. Could you tell me how to get involved?")}"
          }
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-5 py-2.5 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-700 text-white text-sm font-bold rounded-xl transition-colors duration-150"
        >
          Send a Message <.icon name="hero-arrow-right" class="w-4 h-4" />
        </.link>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- Google Calendar --%>
  <div class="border-t border-zinc-100 py-12 mb-2">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-3 mb-6">
      <span class="inline-flex items-center justify-center w-9 h-9 rounded-full bg-zinc-100 text-zinc-600 flex-shrink-0">
        <.icon name="hero-calendar" class="w-5 h-5" />
      </span>
      <h2 class="text-xl font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">
        Choir Calendar
      </h2>
    </div>
    <div class="w-full overflow-hidden rounded-xl border border-zinc-200">
      <iframe
        id="choir-google-calendar"
        src="https://calendar.google.com/calendar/embed?src=c_f9fe96ca412f8a0ba8c8e1e7175731b55810fe3d2ad30e85996c2909a4a31af8%40group.calendar.google.com&ctz=America%2FLos_Angeles"
        class="w-full border-0"
        height="600"
        frameborder="0"
        scrolling="no"
        title="YSC Choir Calendar"
      >
      </iframe>
    </div>
  </div>

  <%!-- About Section --%>
  <div class="border-t border-zinc-100 py-12">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-12">
      <div class="prose prose-zinc prose-a:text-blue-600 max-w-none">
        <div class="not-prose flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <.icon name="hero-user-group" class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" />
          <h3 class="font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">Who Can Join</h3>
        </div>
        <p>
          The choir is open to all YSC members. Whether you've sung in choirs your whole life or the last time you sang was at a school play, there's a spot for you. We believe in singing for the love of it.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-zinc prose-a:text-blue-600 max-w-none">
        <div class="not-prose flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <.icon name="hero-musical-note" class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" />
          <h3 class="font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">What We Sing</h3>
        </div>
        <p>
          Our repertoire draws from Scandinavian folk traditions, Nordic hymns, classical choral standards, and seasonal music. We regularly perform at YSC events including the Midsommar celebration, the holiday dinner, and our annual spring concert.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="prose prose-zinc prose-a:text-blue-600 max-w-none">
        <div class="not-prose flex items-center gap-2 mb-3">
          <.icon name="hero-star" class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" />
          <h3 class="font-black text-zinc-900 tracking-tight">
            Your First Rehearsal
          </h3>
        </div>
        <p>
          Just show up on a Sunday evening. No need to pre-register — introduce yourself to the choir director and join right in. Sheet music is provided. We recommend arriving a few minutes early to get settled before we warm up at 7:00 PM.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
